										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>PTFE Products List</h2>
<p>PTFE moulded rod , PTFE moulded pipe , PTFE moulded sheet , PTFE moulded tube</p>
<p>PTFE extruded rod , PTFE extruded pipe, PTFE extruded tube , PTFE container</p>
<p>PTFE skived sheet , PTFE film , PTFE blank</p>
<p>PTFE tape , PTFE raw strip , PTFE axle cover , PTFE distributor , PTFE bolt , PTFE corrugated pipe , PTFE protecting jacket , PTFE valve block , PTFE fittings , PTFE isolating rod , PTFE scraper , PTFE orifice plate , PTFE orifice plate , PTFE liquid collector , PTFE corrugated flexible tube , PTFE seal parts, PTFE isolating sleeve , PTFE chlorine pipe , PTFE strengthened scraper , PTFE ball , PTFE filter mantle , PTFE filling ring , PTFE spool , PTFE filling ring for tower , PTFE steel pipeline , PTFE cone cover , PTFE subulate cover , PTFE ball pad , PTFE steel container , PTFE sealing products , PTFE packing ring , PTFE expansion joint</p>
<h2><strong>Characters </strong></h2>
<p>PTFE has a series of excellent properties :</p>
<p>1,  high temperature resistance :  continous working temperature 240℃, peak up to 260℃ .</p>
<p>2,  Low temperature resistance :  it can keep soft at – 100 ℃ ;</p>
<p>3,  Corrosion resistance ;</p>
<p>4,  Weather resistance ;</p>
<p>5,  High lubrication ;</p>
<p>6,  Non sticky ;</p>
<p>7,  Harmless ;</p>
<p>8,  Application : Military , atomic energy , fossil oil , ratio , electric machinery , chemical industry , ect.</p>
